      "title": "Evaluate the powers in order",
      "explanation": "First compute the sum in the exponent, then evaluate the powers before subtracting:\n\\[\n2^{1+2+3}-(2^1+2^2+2^3)\n=2^6-(2+4+8)\n=64-14\n=50.\n\\]\nThe answer is \\(\\boxed{50}\\), choice \\(\\text{B}\\).",
